{
"file": 4,
"paths": [
"d002/f587"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "8a992089",
"en_raw": "Nao, do you have no sense of direction?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "17b02eb7",
"en_raw": "Not that I've"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "6248b10e",
"en_raw": "ever thought so"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "e9b53a73",
"en_raw": "Then"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "385caa6e",
"en_raw": "Do you know about Lost Street?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "bab9539b",
"en_raw": "No, I don't"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "e9754063",
"en_raw": "It's on Mukaibashi Street"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "059b866a",
"en_raw": "the back street of the office district"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "a422123f",
"en_raw": "At a glance it's nothing unusual"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "fd952634",
"en_raw": "just a street of houses, apparently"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "60ea4f9b",
"en_raw": "...That area"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "277f5410",
"en_raw": "I've never been either"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "d780b2bf",
"en_raw": "So, from what I heard"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "6cea5d2b",
"en_raw": "a traveler who wanders into that street"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "de564921",
"en_raw": "keeps walking in circles in the same place"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "8d3f5d5d",
"en_raw": "and in the end..."
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "62e3ffe6",
"en_raw": "dies by the roadside"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "a3721fcd",
"en_raw": "...No way"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "bec8125f",
"en_raw": "So when you go through there"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "cea3e4dc",
"en_raw": "never, ever let go of hands"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "d873af41",
"en_raw": "because letting go is the end"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "2cfd5d75",
"en_raw": "Then let's go"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "905e640b",
"en_raw": "and see if you really get lost"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "f32bc36d",
"en_raw": "...I'm not holding hands"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "46624182",
"en_raw": "On Mukaibashi Avenue"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "52866347",
"en_raw": "in the office district..."
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "2af02782",
"en_raw": "past the crosswalk"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "adc169ff",
"en_raw": "behind there, apparently"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "998634c6",
"en_raw": "A place Kurumi doesn't know"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "809189de",
"en_raw": "Want to go, want to go quick!"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "5fbd1639",
"en_raw": "If we don't get lost"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "d4af8190",
"en_raw": "I'll complain to Inagaki tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "093171c9",
"en_raw": "...Hey, you two"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "64d8c85f",
"en_raw": "where were you?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "4bee96e1",
"en_raw": "That's my line"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "20c657ad",
"en_raw": "Nao, where did you go"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "71533db6",
"en_raw": "all by yourself?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "2079c899",
"en_raw": "Where did I go...?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "4ec76774",
"en_raw": "I turned a corner and"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "788780a3",
"en_raw": "you two didn't follow"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "d7c94f80",
"en_raw": "me"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "74b51c21",
"en_raw": "I got so lost!"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "da0d5b3f",
"en_raw": "Huh, you were on that street all along?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "88c6312f",
"en_raw": "We totally thought"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "dce373f0",
"en_raw": "Nao had gone straight home"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "1e9713f2",
"en_raw": "and we were eating ice cream"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "38a22546",
"en_raw": "Kurumi got treated to"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "2aebfde3",
"en_raw": "a Guriguri-kun!"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "c496fa61",
"en_raw": "That's awful..."
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "76786f39",
"en_raw": "So you're saying it's really"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "617e24cd",
"en_raw": "truly Lost Street?"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "5c14ca77",
"en_raw": "No way"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "6b007c2c",
"en_raw": "The only ones who'd get lost there"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "5f214f89",
"en_raw": "are Nao and Inagaki"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "61b919c6",
"en_raw": "Then Sango"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "df511c24",
"en_raw": "should go by herself"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "b923b24a",
"en_raw": "Fine, fine, but"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "71d4e08c",
"en_raw": "what if you don't get lost?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "10d20f67",
"en_raw": "I don't really get it, but"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "fed3f3eb",
"en_raw": "that street"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "3053fca5",
"en_raw": "doesn't lead anywhere"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "5efbf255",
"en_raw": "you just go around the same place"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "593207a8",
"en_raw": "And there doesn't seem to be a road"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "81b8036b",
"en_raw": "out toward the temple either..."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "3c21ef12",
"en_raw": "So it's just a dead end?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "c21366e7",
"en_raw": "Well, yeah"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "62d4f663",
"en_raw": "Lost Street, my foot"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "547c0742",
"en_raw": "Sango, you liar..."
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "e1238475",
"en_raw": "Still, if Nao goes"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "e9d0310d",
"en_raw": "he might get lost"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "2cd87ba2",
"en_raw": "No way"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "79fc3845",
"en_raw": "But that tall wall, what's"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "0f2aebff",
"en_raw": "behind it, I wonder"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "b7f98f97",
"en_raw": "Just a house, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "2bf4a494",
"en_raw": "I bet in there"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "c469a218",
"en_raw": "some secret"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "3aa7cf3a",
"en_raw": "is being hidden"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "02bf1d63",
"en_raw": "Don't you think so?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "2c15dffc",
"en_raw": "No way, you're overthinking it"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "d22805d5",
"en_raw": "Man, you're no fun"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "0c2d9821",
"en_raw": "Shiina might find it"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "d102e73c",
"en_raw": "That strangely tall wall"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "5db69786",
"en_raw": "does bug me"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "ccf9d49a",
"en_raw": "Hey, how about going"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "31a13a8d",
"en_raw": "back there once more?"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "06cd09d5",
"en_raw": "Hey, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "f4e386f3",
"en_raw": "How could you possibly"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "0648473f",
"en_raw": "get lost there?"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "5fadc25b",
"en_raw": "Anyway, it's true"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "e7479c50",
"en_raw": "I did get lost"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "581caf94",
"en_raw": "You just don't realize that"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "b100aff7",
"en_raw": "you have no sense of direction, Nao"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "a7909077",
"en_raw": "That can't be..."
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "f1037294",
"en_raw": "Then what is it?"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "cd2a546c",
"en_raw": "Are you saying there's a magnetic field"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "022d7661",
"en_raw": "that messes up your sense of direction?"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "8ab1d2a5",
"en_raw": "I'll bring a compass"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "d3f5c41d",
"en_raw": "...Nao, don't tell me"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "37d5c55a",
"en_raw": "you're mad that we left you"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "0b716ff9",
"en_raw": "and ate ice cream?"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "f640797b",
"en_raw": "That's not it!"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "941e2432",
"en_raw": "Then what do you think, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "3fece9df",
"en_raw": "...Hmm, well then"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "baee9386",
"en_raw": "Kurumi should go"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "6e1ef8af",
"en_raw": "Shiina, where did you"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "e26e3314",
"en_raw": "go by yourself?"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "5a0a2171",
"en_raw": "You can't just do what you like"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "6f3247a3",
"en_raw": "You'll really get lost"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "d03e42c3",
"en_raw": "I won't"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "84904c87",
"en_raw": "Really? You didn't get lost?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "a7f9f520",
"en_raw": "A little"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "e9b4a68e",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi is fine"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "164c3b13",
"en_raw": "because the mail person is there"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "3ab4d9cd",
"en_raw": "So in the end, what was"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "3f105171",
"en_raw": "behind the wall?"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "0bc6f772",
"en_raw": "Hee hee, that's..."
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "2f3c94cc",
"en_raw": "What is it, tell me"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "09dc377a",
"en_raw": "It's a se-cret!"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "fd719ffa",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Nao, Sango"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "298cbdd6",
"en_raw": "Let's go again"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "45045ba7",
"en_raw": "Then"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "3de5b611",
"en_raw": "Poppo will surely be there"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "7b6ebce1",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "298cbdd6",
"en_raw": "Let's go again"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "2c9679ec",
"en_raw": "Then, then"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "271ffde9",
"en_raw": "he'll surely be waiting"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "167c8233",
"en_raw": "What the heck was there?"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "b540a91c",
"en_raw": "Tell me already, geez"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "6e9f292f",
"en_raw": "The road circles around a vacant lot"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "cf838bcf",
"en_raw": "Conclusion: you don't get lost"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "a36a0925",
"en_raw": "That proves it"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "b67069f0",
"en_raw": "But what was that"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "128df7cc",
"en_raw": "place, I wonder..."
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "e0719103",
"en_raw": "Just a vacant lot, right?"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "64bd3760",
"en_raw": "Surrounded by house walls"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "2dd9f5c7",
"en_raw": "just a vacant lot"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "a8707aae",
"en_raw": "But that little shrine"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "98c6bafb",
"en_raw": "nobody can get to it, right?"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "c21366e7",
"en_raw": "Well, yeah"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "a3346966",
"en_raw": "Is that okay...?"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "0cf1d906",
"en_raw": "Things like that"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "9d2e882f",
"en_raw": "Is what okay?"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "9f59775f",
"en_raw": "That feeling, I don't"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "24cf05da",
"en_raw": "get it at all"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "f7da1942",
"en_raw": "No, Nao"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "5d62c596",
"en_raw": "Kurumi, you see"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "fc03742b",
"en_raw": "promised, I'll come again"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "3153cabe",
"en_raw": "...Who did you promise?"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "617933d5",
"en_raw": "The young master inside the wall!"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "fd58c641",
"en_raw": "Poppo, he's a god"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "956b090b",
"en_raw": "just like Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "07c07ecc",
"en_raw": "loves hide-and-seek!"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "ed25ad6c",
"en_raw": "Poppo, you see"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "2a68b353",
"en_raw": "is a shy one"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "f3ebe64c",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of Lost Street"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "5d78a2cc",
"en_raw": "By the way, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "f8b0f594",
"en_raw": "from that vacant lot"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "fbc35c79",
"en_raw": "how did you get out?"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "f1df93aa",
"en_raw": "Right, now that I think about it"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "e881c0c5",
"en_raw": "there's no way out of there"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "fbc431de",
"en_raw": "from the young master's house"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "440e4e65",
"en_raw": "I climbed over the wall"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "525c9cbd",
"en_raw": "...Heave-ho"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "9d9e285a",
"en_raw": "Shiina, could it be"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "db89096f",
"en_raw": "you stepped on that little"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "9cba31a2",
"en_raw": "shrine...?"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "6396d418",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}